{room, key=cult_temple, name=Temple
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }


    {enter_message
        output={@
You find yourself in what appears to be a vast temple.
Chairs line the left and right walls of the temple, with
a path leading forward to an altar.
Just behind the altar, hovering in air, is a large, purple, neon circle lighting
up the entire space.

Bowing before the circle you see hooded figures.

A tall individual emerges from behind the altar. It is wearing a red hooded cloak
and a deer skull mask with glowing neon antlers.
It floats up to you and stops, standing motionless for a long moment.

"What, my friend, is the password?"

        }

        {logic, name=Deepgrid cult temple tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You look around...

Chairs line the left and right walls of the temple.
There is an altar.
Just behind the altar, hovering in air, is a large, purple, neon circle lighting
up the entire space.

Bowing before the circle you see hooded figures.

The tall figure still stands before you.

"I must insist, my friend, what is the password?"

            }
        }
    }

    {look_nochip
        {message
            output={@
You don't have the chip!

            }
        }
    }



    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((look))
        {act, logic=look, tags=!_type|room }

        {logic
            logic={@
                ?[invite_chip]parent = [player]
            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((look))
        {act, logic=look_nochip, tags=!_type|room }

        {logic
            logic={@
                ?[invite_chip]parent != [player]
            }
        }
    }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((fidelis))
        {move, logic=cult_inner_sanctum, tags=[player]
            output={@
You are taken into the inner sanctum.

            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((nonfidelis))
        {move, logic=deepspace, tags=[player]
            output={@
Everything goes dark...

            }
        }
    }
}
